  },
  "descriptionKey": "- This data comes from two sources: The paper \"Emptying the oceans: a summary of industrial whaling catches in the 20th century\" by Rocha et al. for data pre-1985, and the International Whaling Commission (IWC) for data after 1985.\n- Data pre-1985 does not include aboriginal subsistence whaling as it focusses on industrial whaling. Data after 1985 from the IWC includes subsistence whaling.\n- Data before 1985 does not include illegal catches by the Soviet Union, as they are not available as a yearly breakdown. They are included in our [catches by decade](https://ourworldindata.org/grapher/whales-killed-per-decade).",
